{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A brutal rogue-lite platformer where curses define your destiny.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each curse adds a unique challenge, forcing you to adapt or die. Risk everything for power in a world that punishes and rewards you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collector of Souls</strong>: You posess the ability to steal enemies souls after they die. you can secure the souls through soul spheres and use them after death to permanently increase your stats and upgrade spells.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace powerful curses that twist your journey. Some will blind you, summon spikes from below, or rain down freezing hail, but <strong>survive them</strong>, and you can exchange them for <strong>game-changing blessings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curses are double-edged. Risk devastating effects for greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/70bdf490761390adb413db177e0139ad.poster.avif?t=1768943851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/70bdf490761390adb413db177e0139ad.webm?t=1768943851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/70bdf490761390adb413db177e0139ad.mp4?t=1768943851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blessings can <strong>heal</strong>, <strong>shield</strong>, or <strong>grant new abilities</strong> that dramatically shift your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/d6abbff3db4f54df8c953d0dcd5c10a3.poster.avif?t=1768943851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/d6abbff3db4f54df8c953d0dcd5c10a3.webm?t=1768943851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/d6abbff3db4f54df8c953d0dcd5c10a3.mp4?t=1768943851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat:</strong> Traverse diverse biomes teeming with unique, formidable enemies. They may seem insurmountable at first, but with every death, you gain the experience needed to overcome them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/baf7afe49f42480bd7654325b380c7a8.poster.avif?t=1768943851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/baf7afe49f42480bd7654325b380c7a8.webm?t=1768943851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/baf7afe49f42480bd7654325b380c7a8.mp4?t=1768943851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cities:</strong> Discover cities where you can delve into the lore of the world, learn about spells, and enhance your weapons and stats through <strong>temporary upgrades</strong> available in local stores. You can also dive deep into the <strong>story</strong> of the blessed lands and learn about it's people and history. Interact with mysterious NPCs, some may offer help, others need yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter but who you help is entirely up to you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/e802d024c513847234ef0bc7a3640582.poster.avif?t=1768943851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/e802d024c513847234ef0bc7a3640582.webm?t=1768943851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/extras/e802d024c513847234ef0bc7a3640582.mp4?t=1768943851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2553360?t=1768943851","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2553360?t=1768943851","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/190eafb2c9d60f52332bb013e049791bdaa04471/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768943851","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553360/190eafb2c9d60f52332bb013e049791bdaa04471/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768943851","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3169350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A brutal rogue-lite platformer where curses define your destiny.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each curse adds a unique challenge, forcing you to adapt or die. Risk everything for power in a world